  "body": "Set in the popular Strathmill community, this brand-new single-level home offers modern comfort, quality finishes and an easy-care lifestyle. Perfect for first-home buyers, downsizers or investors, it also enjoys convenient access to Orewa and SH1, with the future Flavell Drive connection making it even easier to get around.\r\n\r\nFeatures you will love:\r\n\r\n• 3 bedrooms and 2 modern bathrooms, including a master with a walk-in wardrobe and ensuite\r\n\r\n• Bright open-plan living and dining area\r\n\r\n• Modern kitchen with storage space\r\n\r\n• Single internal-access garage\r\n\r\n• 10-Year Master Build Guarantee\r\n\r\nJust minutes from Orewa Beach, schools, parks, shops, cafés and motorway access, this is a quality new home in a growing and well-connected neighbourhood.\r\n\r\nContact us today for more information or visit one of our open homes.\r\n\r\nSee interactive features for this property on barfoot.co.nz. Click the \"View office website\" link at the bottom of this page.",
